      evaluation-cost-disclosure standard or "evaluation provenance" framework within Q2 2026.
      Whether a frontier lab discloses its annual evaluation-compute spend alongside
      training-compute spend in any form (research blog, system card, regulatory filing). Either
      converts this from practitioner observation to operational standard.
    </p>
